## Tables Structure Reference

### 1. `Admin`
Stores administrator accounts credentials, status, and Multi-Factor Authentication configurations.

| Field Name | Type | Modifiers / Attributes | Default / Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `id` | `String` | `@id`, UUID | Primary key |
| `email` | `String` | `@unique` | Admin login email |
| `password` | `String` | | Hashed password |
| `name` | `String` | | Admin display name |
| `twoFactorEnabled` | `Boolean` | | `false` |
| `twoFactorMethod` | `String?` | | `"email"` |
| `twoFactorSecret` | `String?` | | Secret key for Authenticator apps |
| `backupCodes` | `String?` | | Backup recovery codes |
| `failedAttempts` | `Int` | | `0` (tracks failed log-in attempts) |
| `lockedUntil` | `DateTime?` | | Cooldown block timestamp after repeated login failures |
| `createdAt` | `DateTime` | | `now()` |
| `updatedAt` | `DateTime` | `@updatedAt` | Auto-updates on edit |

---

