Maintains records for employee staff accounts, first-time status, lock limits, and associations.

| Field Name | Type | Modifiers / Attributes | Default / Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `id` | `String` | `@id`, UUID | Primary key |
| `email` | `String` | `@unique` | Employee email |
| `username` | `String` | `@unique` | Unique login username |
| `password` | `String` | | Hashed password |
| `name` | `String` | | Full name |
| `isFirstLogin` | `Boolean` | | `true` (forces password change on first login) |
| `twoFactorEnabled` | `Boolean` | | `false` |
| `failedAttempts` | `Int` | | `0` (tracks failed log-in attempts) |
| `lockedUntil` | `DateTime?` | | Cooldown block timestamp |
| `createdAt` | `DateTime` | | `now()` |
| `updatedAt` | `DateTime` | `@updatedAt` | |

