### 3. `UserAiKey`
Stores API keys of AI providers defined by employees.

| Field Name | Type | Modifiers / Attributes | Default / Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `id` | `String` | `@id`, UUID | Primary key |
| `employeeId` | `String` | Foreign Key (Cascade) | Belongs to `Employee.id` |
| `provider` | `String` | | AI Provider (e.g. `"openai"`, `"gemini"`, `"groq"`, `"claude"`, `"openrouter"`) |
| `hashedKey` | `String` | | Encrypted/hashed key value |
| `maskedKey` | `String` | | Partially hidden key (e.g. `gsk-...abcd`) |
| `isActive` | `Boolean` | | `true` |
| `createdAt` | `DateTime` | | `now()` |
| `updatedAt` | `DateTime` | `@updatedAt` | |

*Constraints:* `@unique([employeeId, provider])` (One active key configuration per provider per employee).

