### 5. `EmailAssignment`
Resolves assignment mapping between Employees and SMTP configurations.

| Field Name | Type | Modifiers / Attributes | Default / Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `id` | `String` | `@id`, UUID | Primary Key |
| `employeeId` | `String` | Foreign Key (Cascade) | Maps to `Employee.id` |
| `emailAccountId` | `String` | Foreign Key (Cascade) | Maps to `EmailConfig.id` |

*Constraints:* `@unique([employeeId, emailAccountId])` (Prevent duplicate identical assignments).

