### 14. `Target`
Quota targets for automated emails associated with clients and projects.

| Field Name | Type | Modifiers / Attributes | Default / Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `id` | `String` | `@id`, UUID | Primary Key |
| `clientId` | `String` | Foreign Key (Cascade) | Belongs to `Client.id` |
| `projectId` | `String` | Foreign Key (Cascade) | Belongs to `Project.id` |
| `mailCount` | `Int` | | Target email frequency quota |
| `frequency` | `String` | | `"DAILY"`, `"WEEKLY"`, `"MONTHLY"` |
| `currentCount` | `Int` | | `0` (running count towards goal) |
| `isCompleted` | `Boolean` | | `false` |
| `lastReset` | `DateTime` | | `now()` (indicates the time of the last quota period reset) |
| `createdAt` | `DateTime` | | `now()` |
| `updatedAt` | `DateTime` | `@updatedAt` | |

*Constraints:* `@unique([clientId, projectId])` (Exactly one target configuration map for each project-client pair).

